                "text": "Congratulations to this year\u2019s #CA25 Congressional App Challenge winners! It\u2019s great to see the incredible talent of our high school students, including those from Calipatria and Niland.\n\nTheir app, MedCentral, aids patients that speak a foreign language or have a disability better understand their medical condition and prescriptions. Amazing, keep innovating!\n \nCheck out KYMA\u2019s coverage of the MedCentral app here: https://t.co/p0SJRrn69K",
