                "text": "With just one day left before the funding deadline, I\u2019m ready to work across the aisle to keep our government open and lower health care costs for the 30,000 people in our communities who would be directly impacted.\n\nUnless Congress acts, tax credits will expire, premiums will skyrocket, and millions, including cancer patients and those with chronic illnesses, could lose their care.",
